<title>FRANCE: Bouygues Offshore falls on weaker dollar.</title>
<headline>Bouygues Offshore falls on weaker dollar.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Bouygues Offshore, which rallied over the past month on the dollar's rise, fell heavily on Monday under the weight of a combination of a dollar slide and a fall on Wall Street, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0845 GMT, Bouygues Offshore was down 5.26 percent at 216.00 francs, following a rise to 232 francs on August 11 from 134.90 on June 24.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
